VP gets no field information for VC-1. It decodes the second field of a
field-interlaced frame wrongly, and the frames after it too, without any
error, and a stream mixing field pictures with interlaced frames hangs
it.

Refuse interlaced pictures, so that end_frame fails and the application
can fall back to software decoding. The check for frame_coding_mode 3
goes: the VA frontend passes field-interlaced pictures as 2.

